baba teri sakina har zulm seh rahi hai<br>
maa fatima zehra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
1. darvaza jal gaya tha tab fatima ke ghar ka,<br>
ab khaimein jal rahe hai manzar wahi hai baba,<br>
daman bhi jal gaya hai chader bhi chin chuki hai.<br>
maa fatima zehra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
2. durre lagaye mujh par khaye hai taziyaneh,<br>
dadi ki tarha mujhpar barsa gaye tamachay,<br>
kal ka woh saneha tha rudad ye nayi hai.<br>
maa fatima zehra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
3. dono hue yateem aaur dono ko baap ka gham,<br>
dono ne zalimo se chup kar kiya hai matam,<br>
dono kay gham mein duniya aansu baha rahi hai.<br>
maa fatima zehra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
4. pehlu mein fatima kay mohsin ko maar dala,<br>
haatho pe teray baba asghar ne teer khaya,<br>
asghar ke khoo se khoshboo mohsin ki aa rahi hai.<br>
maa fatima zehra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
5. zakhmi hai kaan meray zakhmi hai mera chehra,<br>
balon se lag rahi hoon baba main ek zaieefa,<br>
jo fatima pe guzri mujhpar guzar rahi hai.<br>
maa fatima zahra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
6. main oont se zamee par rahon mein girr rahi<br>
hoon,<br>
dadi kay dard ko mai apna bana chuki hoon,<br>
meri bhi phasliyo se awaaz aa rahi hai.<br>
maa fatima zahra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
7. hakim ne tab kiya tha taoheen syeda ki,<br>
touheen yeh kar rahe hai baba ye abb tumhari,<br>
woh sakht imtehan tha yeh sabr ki ghadi hai.<br>
maa fatima zahra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
8. tarikh mein milega na koi kam sini mein,<br>
bann jaye yu zaeefa ek din ki roshini mein,<br>
bas aik fatima aur ek ladili teri hai.<br>
maa fatima zahra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
9. darbaar e aam mein woh darbaar e aam me<br>
main,<br>
zindaan e jaa me woh thi zindaan e shaam me main,<br>
woh unki be-kasi thi ye meri be-basi hai.<br>
maa fatima zahra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
10. guzri thi jabke zahra baba the tum bhi kamsin,<br>
wirsay me main ne tumsay yeh dard paya lekin,<br>
tab tum toh jee gaye thay beti yeh marr rahi hai.<br>
maa fatima zahra ki tasveer bann gayi hai<br>
<br>
11. kehta hai akhtari yeh sar peet kar raza se,<br>
aao chale madina gham shaam ka sunanay,<br>
rokar kahengay bibi kya zulm aaj bhi hai.<br>
maa fatima zahra ki tasveer bann gayi hai